{\f0\fs18\cf3\bullet\cf0  }{\f0\fs18  Case Library \emdash  20+ sources (federal courts, all 50 state AGs, agencies, news)\par}
{\f0\fs18\cf3\bullet\cf0  }{\f0\fs18  Document Viewer \emdash  PDF, DOCX, XLSX, HTML, images, video\par}
