\par

{\f0\fs20\b\cf1 Unlock AI features (optional \emdash  free API key):\par}
{\f0\fs18\cf4\bullet\cf0  }{\f0\fs18  AI Investigation Agent \emdash  research any legal matter across courts + the web\par}
{\f0\fs18\cf4\bullet\cf0  }{\f0\fs18  AI Bill Analysis \emdash  harm assessment, constitutional review, mobilization steps\par}
