\par

{\f0\fs20\b\cf1 Getting Started in 3 steps:\par}
{\f0\fs18\b 1. Populate the Case Library\par}
{\f0\fs18    Open the app 薔  click \ldblquote Case Library\rdblquote  薔  \ldblquote Sync Manager\rdblquote  薔  Run Selected Syncs\par}
{\f0\fs18    The first sync loads federal courts, agencies, and state AGs into your local database.\par}
\par
{\f0\fs18\b 2. Search & Browse\par}
{\f0\fs18    Use the search bar to find cases by keyword, source, court, or date range.\par}
{\f0\fs18    Click any case to open its full detail page with all available data and documents.\par}
\par
{\f0\fs18\b 3. Set Up Alerts (optional)\par}
{\f0\fs18    Go to the Alerts tab, create a rule with keywords (e.g. "AI lending discrimination"),\par}
{\f0\fs18    enter your email, and click Save. You'll receive email when new matches appear.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs20\b\cf1 Key features at a glance:\par}

{\f0\fs18\b Investigate\par}
{\f0\fs18    Describe any legal matter in plain English. Three AI agents research CourtListener,\par}
{\f0\fs18    federal agencies, and the web, then synthesize a full case-intelligence report.\par}
{\f0\fs18    Export as PDF, Word (.docx), Markdown, or JSON.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs18\b Legislative Watch\par}
{\f0\fs18    Detects multi-state bill waves, pre-emption threats, and fast-moving legislation.\par}
{\f0\fs18    AI can analyze any bill for community harm, constitutional concerns, and urgent actions.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs18\b Precedent Research\par}
{\f0\fs18    Describe a situation; AI identifies controlling precedents and traces legal evolution.\par}
{\f0\fs18    Citation chain mode maps which cases cite each other.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs18\b Media Forensics\par}
{\f0\fs18    Upload photos, video, or text. Claude Vision analyzes for deepfakes, AI generation,\par}
{\f0\fs18    EXIF tampering, and 12+ manipulation indicators. Returns a HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW verdict.\par}
{\f0\fs18    Note: provides investigative leads only \emdash  obtain certified forensic analysis for legal use.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs20\b\cf1 Free integration keys (raise data limits):\par}
{\f0\fs18\b CourtListener Token}{\f0\fs18 : courtlistener.com/help/api  (raises federal court rate limits)\par}
{\f0\fs18\b Congress.gov Key}{\f0\fs18 : api.congress.gov/sign-up  (federal legislation sync)\par}
{\f0\fs18\b OpenStates Key}{\f0\fs18 : openstates.org/accounts/login  (all 50 state legislatures)\par}
{\f0\fs18\b Regulations.gov Key}{\f0\fs18 : api.regulations.gov  (full dockets + public comments)\par}
{\f0\fs18 All keys are entered in the sidebar 薔  Integration Keys and stored in Windows Credential Manager.\par}
\par

{\f0\fs20\b\cf1 Security & Privacy:\par}
{\f0\fs18 All API keys are stored in Windows Credential Manager \emdash  never in files, logs, or source code.\par}
{\f0\fs18 The app runs entirely on your local machine. No case data, queries, or client information\par}
{\f0\fs18 is sent to any external server except the APIs you explicitly configure.\par}
{\f0\fs18 Your full user guide is saved as }{\f0\fs18\b LegalPerigee_User_Guide.pdf}{\f0\fs18  in the installation folder.\par}
\par
